  "body": "Positioned in an established neighborhood surrounded by quality homes, this elevated 837 m² (approx.) freehold section offers a rare opportunity to build your dream home with sweeping, panoramic sea views. Enjoy an enviable coastal lifestyle with everyday conveniences, top schools, and leisure right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nUnmatched Coastal Lifestyle\r\n\r\n• Minutes to Key Amenities: Close to Gulf Harbour Marina, the ferry terminal, Gulf Harbour Country Club golf course, and multiple stunning beaches.\r\n• Outdoor & Recreation: Shakespeare Regional Park is just around the corner for scenic walking trails, swimming, picnics, and sailing.\r\n• Everyday Convenience: A short drive to New World, Woolworths, Coast Plaza, local cafés, restaurants, the Leisure Centre, and the library.\r\n• Close to well-regarded local schools, and only moments from Wentworth College.\r\n\r\nEffortless Commuting & Future Growth\r\n\r\nCommuting to the Auckland CBD is seamless via the Gulf Harbour ferry or regular local bus services. Connectivity is set to improve even further with Penlink opening soon—providing a vital second route off the Whangaparaoa Peninsula to State Highway 1, alongside a dedicated shared path for walking and cycling.\r\nSections with views of this caliber in an established location do not last long. Act fast—contact us today to secure your future!",
